WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
Hey guys how is it going?

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.800
Um, I know this is a late upload

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.420
and I'm kind of late to my own 12 million party,

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.300
but that's because I didn't know that I was going to be making

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.300
a dedicated video like this.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.640
Because after me and the boys worked very hard on 'WOOF'

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.860
and, we set out to make that bigger and better

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.400
and funnier than 'MEOW',

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.000
and we think it's good, but I'll leave the judgement up to you guys.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.280
You guys can check out 'WOOF', compare the two,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.660
I don't care, links are in the description.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.880
Um, but as far as this video goes,

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:34.500
I didn't want to do a dedicated video because

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:38.100
part of me feels like I must sound annoying?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.580
For how many times I repeat myself.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:41.920
And...

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.420
I-I just got out of the shower, it's why my hair's still wet

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.040
and I was thinking about...

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.420
You know, this whole Youtube thing that I do

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.520
and this whole channel that I have

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.280
and this dialogue that I have with you guys

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.200
and um...

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.320
It-it's really interesting, because...

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.540
On April 4th of 2012, I believe that's the day

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.660
I might be wrong, it's so long ago now,

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.200
I uploaded my first video to YouTube

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.480
and when I think about that...

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.200
You know, I think back on...

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:15.860
You know, the smaller aspect of the channel that I have-

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:16.660
had-

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:21.000
and I think about the more intimate moments that I had

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.000
uh...

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:23.320
during that time.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.460
And a lot of it is because it was very fresh and new

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.520
and it was like a new adventure to me

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.820
and it was new and interesting and everything was new and,

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.700
and every single milestone that I got, you know,

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.900
was a new adventure and a new amazing thing

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.780
and no one had ever done that, even though a lot of people had done that already.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:41.540
But for me, it was really new and interesting and amazing

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:46.580
and... you know, that feeling has not really diminished all that much.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.840
It still amazes me, you know, 12 million.

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.200
It's like 'What the hell is that? Is that a number?'

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.220
I don't even know!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.500
And so, you know I think about these things-

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.200
I'm sorry if I got lettuce in my teeth, I dunno-

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.320
- but I think about these things and I look back and I'm like

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.140
'Did I feel the same way? Oh yeah, I did!'

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.500
I remember, I was just a dumb goof that was amazed

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.220
that anyone watched his videos in the first place.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.060
And...

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:11.580
You know, I...

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:15.120
I was, ah, I looked back right before I recorded this video

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:19.160
I got a little teary-eyed because there's one video that I can always look back on

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.520
and remember and...

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.860
It always gets me and some of you guys have seen it

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:27.260
if you haven't, I'll link it in the description too.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:33.380
It's the... Markiplier Project 20000 subscriber milestone video, and...

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.300
That video...

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.180
is very, very special to me.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:44.180
And mostly-mostly because of the part where Bob speaks

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:44.880
I can't even-

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.360
Just thinking about it kinda gets me

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:50.020
I, I remember the part where Bob speaks

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.740
and I have it like, right here

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:54.420
and I'm afraid to play it 'cause I'm gonna start crying

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.120
and it's not gonna be good, but-

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:57.220
What...

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:58.960
You know...

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:01.740
Ah, fuck it.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:04.320
Bob: 'He is exactly the guy that you think he is.'

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:06.820
'Um, I know there are a lot of people on the internet'

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:09.760
'Who uh, you know, seem kind of fake'

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:15.360
'and uh, and people have accused Mark before of, you know, his reactions aren't sincere'

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:17.380
'he yells just to be ridiculous. But..'

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:20.200
'He's exactly the guy that it seems like he is.'

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.720
'I've been friends with him for years now, and...'

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:24.200
*Bob chuckles*

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:30.640
'It's just so great to see people finally appreciate what I've always known was-'

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:31.660
Mark: *interrupting* Okay, anyway.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:37.140
It's, it's the moment where Bob, you know he vouches for me, and...

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.100
The fact that he does that is...

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:44.660
It's- it's, it's really meaningful to me.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:47.900
And, you know, that- that...

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:51.220
And everything else that everyone said in the video,

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.940
and the things that people have said in videos down the road-

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:54.680
Goddammit!

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:56.980
Gaaah I didn't want to do this!

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:57.860
Ergh!

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.900
The things that people have said in other videos that are dedicated to me

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.880
and the fact that anything's dedicated to me at all,

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.220
is... you know, astonishing!

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:13.500
It's incredible, it's so stupid that I deserve any of this!

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.140
I don't! I don't deserve any of this! And...

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:16.840
You know...

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.660
I'm really, really, really grateful.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.160
I really, really am grateful!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.660
I'm so grateful, you guys don't know...

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:31.820
You guys don't know like, what I've been through!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:34.540
To get here!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.180
Ahhh.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.000
[Grunting]

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:42.620
Ah man, you guys don't know how grateful I am

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:46.420
and you guys don't know how grateful I am that I get to do this

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:52.300
and I say it over and over and that's where I'm afraid that it's coming off as being ridiculous,

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.560
'cause I, I repeat myself so much!

00:04:55.720 --> 00:05:00.040
I say the same thing every time I do a milestone video, I say the same damn thing!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.540
But I am!

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.120
I'm really grateful!

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.340
Like, I really, sincerely am.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.180
I love doing this,

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:13.500
and I love the fact I get to make videos for you guys!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:17.020
And, I know there's a lot of like pessimism on YouTube

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:17.520
and there's a lot-

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:20.520
There's always been stupid shit going on on YouTube

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.860
and trolls here and there, that's always existed.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:27.500
But, I've always been so proud of what you guys have done

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.620
and the stances that you guys have taken

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:33.000
and not letting small things like that bother you,

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.600
because there's so many bigger problems

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.460
than the stupid things that people argue about.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:39.820
Oh man,

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.360
and it's just- it's good to know that...

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:46.600
We, here, can do something really cool.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:49.820
And this weekend, if you didn't know, 26th we're doing a charity livestream

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:53.420
I don't know what charity for, I haven't even had the brainpower to think about it, but...

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:54.380
Just...

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:57.300
Like, thank you guys so much for being here

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.640
and thank you to my friends...

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.120
You know, who's stuck with me and, you know...

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:07.820
I think, like, there's people that I've disappointed on the way coming up here

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:08.760
and there's people that have been-

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:09.880
Aww, Lego...

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:12.420
I think the boys are home.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:14.040
But, you know, there're people that I've-

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:15.160
I've...

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:19.080
Ah, forget it. You know there've been people I've disappointed

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:21.240
and I've tried my best to make everyone happy.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:23.060
And I know I'm not gonna make everyone happy.

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:25.460
I know for a fact I'm not gonna make everyone happy.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.820
But, just thank you guys so much for being here

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.520
and thank you for believing in what I do.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.560
And thank you for...

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:37.260
Being a part of this and what I do,

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.800
because that's really special.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.740
And the boys are definitely home, so I need to wipe my tears

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:45.380
before they start making fun of me.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.880
So, anyway.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.760
Thank you guys again so much for watching

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:53.000
and thank you for 12 million subscribers.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:56.120
I'm sorry, I shed tears again,

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:57.120
didn't mean to do it.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:58.740
I'm a frickin' mess.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.580
But this is all you get, this is all you get.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:05.240
This is the Markiplier you get, he's...

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.140
it's as dumb and stupid as it is.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.580
So thank you everybody so much for watching.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:10.920
And as always,

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.160
I will see YOU

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.680
in the next video!

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.500
Bye-bye!

